      "content": "hey, my husband had a pretty bad flu last week but he's still feeling off. his fever is back up to 103 today and he has a really bad headache too. he's acting kind of slow and confused when we talk, like he's not quite all there. i'm thinking it's just the flu dragging on or something? should i just give him more tylenol and keep him hydrated at home or is this something else?",
